{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context\nThis replacement tree consolidates the retired 1,499-ticket per-file audit into six workstream stories and 117 path-disjoint remediation leaves. The leaves cover 1,514 distinct file-impact paths: 1,499 migrated paths plus 15 paths added without retired-source mappings. This epic makes no repository edits.\n\n## Plan\n- Complete and close every leaf through its recorded checks, independent semantic review, Gerrit gates, merge, and completion verification.\n- Close each workstream after it records the exact migration and execution inventories required by its plan.\n- Concatenate the six story migration TSVs, add `story-alias`, sort by path, and store the 1,499-row result in a dedicated `session_log` linked `relates_to` this epic. Schema: `path<TAB>story-alias<TAB>replacement-leaf-alias<TAB>source-ticket-alias<TAB>scope-count<TAB>file-impact-count`.\n- Concatenate the six story execution TSVs, add `story-alias`, sort by path, and store the 1,514-row result in the same log. Schema: `path<TAB>story-alias<TAB>replacement-leaf-alias<TAB>scope-count<TAB>file-impact-count<TAB>source-count`.\n- Record both row counts and SHA-256 values in the epic completion comment, together with the six story-log ids.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] All six workstream stories are closed.\n- [ ] All 117 remediation leaves are closed.\n- [ ] The epic migration TSV contains exactly 1,499 rows.\n- [ ] The migration TSV contains exactly 1,499 distinct migrated paths.\n- [ ] The migration TSV contains exactly 1,499 distinct retired source tickets.\n- [ ] Every retired source ticket has exactly one net-active live replacement leaf.\n- [ ] Every migration row has `scope-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every migration row has `file-impact-count=1`.\n- [ ] The epic execution TSV contains exactly 1,514 rows.\n- [ ] The execution TSV contains exactly 1,514 distinct paths.\n- [ ] Every execution row has `scope-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every execution row has `file-impact-count=1`.\n- [ ] Exactly 1,499 execution rows have `source-count=1`.\n- [ ] Exactly 15 execution rows have `source-count=0`.\n- [ ] Every migrated Scope constraint has a non-author `semantic-preservation=PASS` row with immutable before/final citations.\n- [ ] Every migrated consumer contract has a non-author `semantic-preservation=PASS` row with immutable before/final citations.\n- [ ] Every edited prose block has a non-author `bloat-removal=PASS` row.\n- [ ] Every recorded leaf verification command exits 0 at its cited commit.\n- [ ] Every leaf completion trail records its Gerrit Change-Id, `LLM-Review +1`, `Verified +1`, and zero unresolved comments.\n- [ ] Every leaf completion trail records Gerrit `MERGED` status and the exact merged commit reachable from `origin/main`.\n- [ ] The epic log records both combined TSVs and all six story-log ids.\n- [ ] The epic completion comment cites the epic log and records both row counts and both SHA-256 values.\n\n## Completion boundary\nClose this epic only after every descendant is closed and every inventory check above passes."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788667288128652001,"uuid":"b172c770-15e8-4d46-99d9-d7235e82d2bf"}